newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/shiny-gold-foil">Shiny Gold Foil</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/cherry-tree-branches-over-the-sun-roof">天窗外的樱桃枝</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sonnet-for-unethical-practices">商籁诗：寡德实验</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/place-to-die">商籁诗：死地</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ballad-for-a-faraway-disaster">远灾谣</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/drcoolbad">Dr. Coolbad Destroys the Economy</a></p> <h2><span>合作作品</span></h2> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lord-blackwood-in-the-land-of-wonder">布莱克伍德爵士漫游奇妙世界</a> - 故事由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607566267" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>写作，图片由我绘制</p> <h2><span>SCP</span></h2> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5320">SCP-5320：如是永远延续之那鱼人民教会</a><br /> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5132">SCP-5132: The Kids Aren't Alright</a></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">（这里是一些我还没写过scp时的旧涂鸦）</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">关闭</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://czyesperanza.wdfiles.com/local--files/pictures/trash1" alt="trash1" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://czyesperanza.wdfiles.com/local--files/pictures/trash2" alt="trash2" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://czyesperanza.wdfiles.com/local--files/pictures/trash3" alt="trash3" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/raddagher-s-toon-zone">喜欢我的画作吗？这里还有更多</a></span></h2> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-silly-doodles">SCP沙雕涂鸦</a></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">点此将我屁股着地发射到太阳上</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我是一个专业艺术家，人们真的会付钱给我做这些</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="http://czyesperanza.wdfiles.com/local--files/pictures/sun" alt="sun" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h2><span>看看我的播客吧！</span></h2> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-radd-zone/html/0509a33b9891404269f180ca036f8b8110e3276e-935255105984038956" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> <p>它叫Find Us Alive，是一个每月更新的叙事型播客<br /> 是有关一个基金会的小站点迷失在了口袋维度里的故事。<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-779391-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup><br /> <a href="https://t.co/cMPtmmQENm?amp=1">这里是收听地址！</a><br /> <a href="https://twitter.com/Site107">这里是推特账号！</a></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4113182&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607566267" alt="Esperanza_Cai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4113182)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" >Esperanza_Cai</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-779391-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 也是基金会的毒贩子但只在周四营业</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-779391-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. 这个播客也是我不会特别经常地在维基上发帖的原因，因为我整个月都要写作和制作这个疯狂的节目</div> </div> 
